9:["$","article",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[[["$","section","problem",{"id":"problem","className":"_articleSection_jtxs5_213","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"_eyebrow_jtxs5_114","children":"The workflow problem"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why file-by-file counting breaks down"}],[["$","p","A project rarely arrives as one clean Word document. It may include a PDF brief, spreadsheets, presentation slides, reference images, and a ZIP archive with more folders inside. Opening each item separately adds time before the actual work begins.",{"children":"A project rarely arrives as one clean Word document. It may include a PDF brief, spreadsheets, presentation slides, reference images, and a ZIP archive with more folders inside. Opening each item separately adds time before the actual work begins."}],["$","p","The bigger risk is not only speed. A hidden attachment, unsupported scan, or duplicate manual entry can change the quotation. A batch workflow should preserve the result for every file as well as the overall total.",{"children":"The bigger risk is not only speed. A hidden attachment, unsupported scan, or duplicate manual entry can change the quotation. A batch workflow should preserve the result for every file as well as the overall total."}]],"$undefined",false]}],["$","section","workflow",{"id":"workflow","className":"_articleSection_jtxs5_213","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"_eyebrow_jtxs5_114","children":"A repeatable process"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Four steps from incoming folder to a clear total"}],[["$","p","Keep the original project structure intact, process the complete batch, and review exceptions before using the total in a quotation or internal record.",{"children":"Keep the original project structure intact, process the complete batch, and review exceptions before using the total in a quotation or internal record."}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"_pointGrid_jtxs5_229","children":[["$","div","1. Add the batch",{"c